    "title": "Second half dominance leads Brockport to Empire 8 Finals - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dylan O’Loughlin ,\n1 days ago It was the Empire 8 Flag Football Semifinals as The No. 2 Brockport Golden Eagles hosted the No. 3 Hartwick Hawks for the third time this season and second time in three days. After going up 21-6 at halftime, the Golden Eagles took over in the second half causing turnovers and scoring 26 points en route to a 47-18 victory. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
